{"indicator":"export_share/equipment","unit":"%","years":[2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024],"notes":{"TWN":"BACI 沒有台灣自己的申報（聯合國不發布台灣的貿易統計），台灣的出口是各進口國申報「原產地是台灣」的進口，在台灣製造、從其他地方出貨的也會算進來。財政部的海關統計（依出口目的地）的半導體設備出口：2024 年 53.0 億美元（比 BACI 多 1%）、2023 年 51.1 億美元（比 BACI 少 3%）；用財政部的數字算，2024 年約占全球 3.7%"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"BACI has no reports from Taiwan itself (the UN does not publish Taiwan's trade statistics): Taiwan's exports are what importing countries recorded as originating in Taiwan, which can include goods made in Taiwan but shipped from elsewhere. Taiwan's Ministry of Finance customs statistics (by destination) show semiconductor equipment exports of US$5.3 billion in 2024 (1% more than BACI) and US$5.1 billion in 2023 (3% less than BACI); using the Ministry's figure, Taiwan's share of the world in 2024 would be about 3.7%"},"encoding":"delta","values":{"AFG":[-6,58,-38,25,-16,-16,29,-28,-8],"ASM":[-6,16,-6,null,-9,30,-19,-11,43],"AND":[-6,931,-927,0,141,-141,0,-4,3],"ARG":[-6,15,30,-15,127,-84,-45,-12,-4],"AUS":[-6,67496,-54784,-1415,306,-1700,1543,-567,10199],"AUT":[-4,7465,699,993,2503,-1400,-73,3062,784],"BHR":[-6,3,31,917,-656,-235,-16,76,247],"BGD":[-6,311,-187,-108,42,80,-108,-14,-9],"ARM":[-6,1093,-732,-238,null,null,59,169,-324],"BEL":[-5,61925,-20868,-31572,-2985,-1262,-399,2441,-477],"BWA":[-6,34,188,-207,-11,null,776,-681,null],"BRA":[-6,459,1007,-618,-320,316,-306,15,15],"SLB":[-6,14,null,null,null,-9,null,-1,null],"BRN":[-6,44,61,-36,198,-265,11,-5,32],"BGR":[-6,17781,430,949,-9555,2358,3770,5150,2336],"BLR":[-6,8691,-3810,3738,2295,-2776,-2346,-5733,-50],"KHM":[-6,7,497,-78,-406,-8,109,258,428],"CMR":[-6,144,-91,14,-13,-20,274,-299,-9],"CAN":[-5,5237,744,-369,2571,-918,2935,-195,-312],"LKA":[-6,1718,-420,-546,1254,1799,-1284,-502,-257],"CHL":[-6,247,-165,13,52,-44,-65,21,131],"CHN":[-4,42763,-106,-3758,5503,-1729,-1478,3454,2966],"CXR":[-6,2,6,null,null,185,-189,null,null],"COL":[-6,18,68,-41,4076,-1150,-2183,-776,9876],"CRI":[-6,2437,7394,-3389,-5